# AICL Example: Season
# AX sub-language — compiles to real code.

Goal:
Month to season

Layer:
Core

Behavior Season
    Input: month
    Output: result
    Action:
        if month >= 3:
            if month <= 5:
                return "spring"
        if month >= 6:
            if month <= 8:
                return "summer"
        if month >= 9:
            if month <= 11:
                return "autumn"
        return "winter"
